{"hw":"μετριόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">μετριόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μετριόω</span> or <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μετριάω</span>, implied by the form <span class=\"gk\">μετριῶ</span> (s.v.l.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theognost.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Can.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">146</span> </span>; but <span class=\"gk\">ἐμετρίωμες, μετριώμεναι</span> are forms of <span class=\"gk\">μετρέω</span> (q.v.).</div>"}